{"delta":{"timeout_pct":0,"avg_sec":16.85,"success_pct":0},"task":"[Автозадача из workpack-serial] Выполни approved задачу бэклога одним последовательным проверяемым проходом.\n\nSerial reason: serial-single-fallback\nFiles: app/src/main/java/com/glass/interpreter/interpreter/interpreterpipeline.kt\nTask: [project-autopilot ch2-interpreter-pipeline] [[NORMAL]] InterpreterPipeline batch orchestrator (record-\u003eSTT-\u003etranslate-\u003eoptional TTS) Project root: C:/Users/rafie/bridge-projects/glass-interpreter. Create app/src/main/java/com/glass/interpreter/interpreter/InterpreterPipeline.kt. depends_on: ch2-interpreter-mode, ch2-pipeline-state (already created). Reuse existing interfaces SpeechToTextClient.transcribe(RecordedAudio, sourceLangHint), TranslationClient.translate(TranslationRequest(sourceText,sourceLang,targetLang)), TtsClient.synthesize(TtsRequest(text,languageTag)) and models RecordedAudio(bytes,sampleRate,durationMs), SttResult(transcript,...), TranslationResult(translatedText,sourceText,targetLang), TtsResult(spokenText,audioBytes,success). CANONICAL public API (tests depend on it): class InterpreterPipeline(private val sttClient: SpeechToTextClient, private val translationClient: TranslationClient, private val ttsClient: TtsClient, private val minRecordingMs: Long = 300L) { val state: kotlinx.coroutines.flow.StateFlow\u003cPipelineState\u003e; suspend fun process(audio: RecordedAudio, mode: InterpreterMode, sourceLang: String, targetLang: String): PipelineState }. BEHAVIOR: (1) If audio.durationMs \u003c minRecordingMs -\u003e set state TooShort and return it WITHOUT calling sttClient. (2) Set ProcessingStt, call sttClient.transcribe(audio, sourceLang); if transcript.isBlank() -\u003e Error with a non-empty Russian message such as \u0027Речь не распознана\u0027 (translation/TTS not called). (3) Set ProcessingTranslation, call translationClient.translate(TranslationRequest(transcript, sourceLang, targetLang)). (4) TTS ONLY when mode == OTHER_TO_USER: set Speaking, call ttsClient.synthesize(TtsRequest(translatedText, targetLang)); if TtsResult.success == false -\u003e terminal Success(spoken=false). When mode == USER_TO_OTHER NEVER call ttsClient. (5) Terminal Success(originalText=transcript, translatedText=..., spoken = (TTS actually spoke)). (6) Any exception from any provider -\u003e caught -\u003e Error with a non-empty Russian message; never rethrow, never silent. (7) Re-entrancy guard: if a process() is already in flight (busy), a new process() returns the current state immediately and must NOT invoke any provider (AtomicBoolean compareAndSet or Mutex). The pipeline does NOT emit Recording (owned by the recorder in a later chapter). Pure Kotlin, NO android.* imports (kotlinx.coroutines allowed). Acceptance: npm run build exit 0; npm run test exit 0; no android imports; public API matches the signature above. Commit with a descriptive message. Chapter: interpreter-pipeline-and-state Wave: wave-2 Kind: feature Parallel group: interpreter Lane: project Depends on: ch2-interpreter-mode, ch2-pipeline-state Acceptance: durationMs\u003c300 -\u003e TooShort without STT; blank transcript and provider exceptions -\u003e Error with non-empty Russian message (acceptance: edge-states, no silent failure) ; exposes StateFlow\u003cPipelineState\u003e; re-entrant process() while busy invokes no provider; no android.* imports; npm run build \u0026 npm run test exit 0 ; process() runs RecordedAudio-\u003eSTT-\u003eTranslation and calls TTS only in OTHER_TO_USER, never in USER_TO_OTHER (acceptance: user-to-other-fake / other-to-user-fake) Checks: npm run build ; npm run test Files: app/src/main/java/com/glass/interpreter/interpreter/interpreterpipeline.kt\n\nПеред STATUS: DONE покажи фактические проверки и не создавай parallel-блоки.","after_turns":134,"after":{"timeout_pct":0,"avg_sec":212.15,"success_pct":1},"hypothesis_ts":"2026-06-27T12:40:44.7509176Z","type":"verdict","verdict":"no_effect","ts":"2026-06-28T23:00:53.